<view class="page">

  <view class="statusbar {{authed ? 'ok' : (connected ? 'warn' : '')}}">
    <view class="dot {{authed ? 'on' : (connected ? 'warn' : '')}}"></view>
    <view class="flex1" style="margin-left:16rpx">
      <view class="status-title">{{deviceName}}</view>
      <view class="status-sub">{{stateText}}</view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn sm ghost" wx:if="{{connected}}" bindtap="onDisconnect">断开</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card autotip" wx:if="{{autoTip}}">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="dot warn"></view>
      <text class="autotip-txt flex1">{{autoTip}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card tipcard" wx:if="{{adapterTip}}">
    <view class="tip-title">{{adapterTip}}</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin:8rpx 0 20rpx">
      安卓扫描蓝牙需要「手机蓝牙开启」+「系统定位权限」；权限被拒会扫不到任何设备。
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <button class="btn sm ghost" style="margin-right:16rpx" bindtap="openBluetoothSetting">打开蓝牙设置</button>
      <button class="btn sm ghost" bindtap="openAppSetting">打开权限设置</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-hd">
      <text class="card-title">我的设备</text>
      <text class="muted">{{bound.length}} 台</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{bound.length === 0}}" class="empty">还没有绑定设备，先在下方扫描并保存</view>

    <view class="devitem" wx:for="{{bound}}" wx:key="deviceId">
      <view class="devitem-top">
        <view class="devitem-name ellipsis">
          {{item.remark || item.name || item.shortId}}
          <text class="tag" wx:if="{{item.deviceId === currentId}}">当前</text>
        </view>
        <view class="devitem-rssi" wx:if="{{item.rssi}}">{{item.rssi}} dBm</view>
      </view>
      <view class="devitem-sub mono ellipsis">{{item.deviceId}}</view>
      <view class="devitem-act">
        <button
          class="btn sm primary"
          data-index="{{index}}"
          bindtap="onConnectBound"
          loading="{{connectingId === item.deviceId}}"
          disabled="{{connectingId !== ''}}"
        >{{item.deviceId === connectedId ? '重新连接' : '连接'}}</button>
        <button class="btn sm" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRename">重命名</button>
        <button class="btn sm danger" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onDelete">删除</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-hd">
      <text class="card-title">附近设备</text>
      <text class="muted">{{scanning ? '扫描中…' : '未扫描'}}</text>
    </view>

    <button class="btn block {{scanning ? '' : 'primary'}}" bindtap="toggleScan">
      {{scanning ? '停止扫描' : '开始扫描'}}
    </button>

    <view class="scanlist" wx:if="{{scan.length}}">
      <view class="devitem" wx:for="{{scan}}" wx:key="deviceId">
        <view class="devitem-top">
          <view class="devitem-name ellipsis">
            {{item.name || '未命名设备'}}
            <text class="tag" wx:if="{{item.mine}}">我的键盘</text>
            <text class="tag gray" wx:elif="{{item.bound}}">已绑定</text>
          </view>
          <view class="devitem-rssi {{item.rssi > -70 ? 'strong' : ''}}">{{item.rssi}} dBm</view>
        </view>
        <view class="devitem-sub mono ellipsis">{{item.deviceId}}</view>
        <view class="devitem-act">
          <button
            class="btn sm primary"
            data-id="{{item.deviceId}}"
            data-index="{{index}}"
            bindtap="onConnectScan"
            loading="{{connectingId === item.deviceId}}"
            disabled="{{connectingId !== ''}}"
          >连接</button>
          <button class="btn sm ghost" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onBindOnly">仅保存</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="empty" wx:elif="{{scanning}}">正在搜索附近的 CH582F…</view>
    <view class="empty" wx:else>点「开始扫描」搜索附近的键盘设备</view>
  </view>

  <view class="muted" style="text-align:center;padding:0 10rpx">
    未找到设备？确认 CH582F 已上电且未连其它主机；UUID 需与 utils/config.js 一致。
  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
